{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1513146-been-watching-knight-rider","id":1513146,"title":"Been watching Knight Rider","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-28T19:05:12-07:00","id":1513146,"title":"Been watching Knight Rider","content":"Such a fun show. Definitely feels like that era of TV makes for a great resource for a Talent focused game in the core book era of the setting. The 80's must have been the heyday of Talents.<br /> <br /> Something I wondered is how would KITT be modeled in the game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27133-planguy","name":"Planguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-29T01:28:39-07:00","id":1513175,"title":"","content":"You have 2 options. As a player character or as a NPC.<br /> <br /> As a NPC you just make it with a few anomalies to represent its capacities, like Hyper intelligent for example.<br /> <br /> As a PC you create a character and make it restricted to being in the car all the time and with control of all aspects of the car, like opening doors and things like that.<br /> <br /> Those are the easy way to go\u2026 to detail more you may need to create a template for AI and make a car that is controlled by it. It\u2019s not hard, it\u2019s not like if it was a transformer or something too weird\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-29T15:18:45-07:00","id":1513240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1513146-been-watching-knight-rider?p=1513175#post1513175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...<br /> <br /> As a PC you create a character and make it restricted to being in the car all the time and with control of all aspects of the car, like opening doors and things like that.<br /> <br /> \u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>Being a car do you give Kitt dots in Athletics or Pilot?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-29T17:25:56-07:00","id":1513250,"title":"","content":"Good question\u2026 I would use Pilot, as the car is not the character but something the character controls, but the other option makes sense too\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-30T07:52:48-07:00","id":1513290,"title":"","content":"This is actually handled by the new TC Player's Guide manuscript. There are a bunch of new vehicle tags, including &quot;AI Driver (Inspired)&quot;. The AI is a moderate threat; designate dice pools in a way that makes sense for a pseudo-intelligent vehicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-30T21:00:30-07:00","id":1513355,"title":"","content":"If this was using the rules for the original setting I would just have KITT be a kind of follower. Just purchase dots in Gadget to represent the super car (I don't think KITT would even qualify for a background enhancement) and purchase dots in Followers to represent KITT being a self willed individual. You don't really have to go over board for buying an AI assistant when the mechanical representation of what KITT can do is easily represented by a competent chauffeur driving a souped up car.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27133-planguy","name":"Planguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-31T00:55:05-07:00","id":1513363,"title":"","content":"I think we have many options here all related to how you deal with KITT as a PC, NPC or as a piece of equipment. My two original options were or PC and NPC, while Shepherdboi is talking about a piece of equipment.<br /> <br /> I really think the point here is how you are going to play it in the group and the importance the car have in the interaction with players.<br /> - If the group is similar to Knight Rider, where you have the driver, the car, and the support crew, you must treat it as a NPC because its a big part of the team (possibly even as a player).<br /> - If you have the team and they just use the car to travel around, with the AI doing not much more than keeping the car availabe whenever needed, than its probably nothing more than a piece of equipment.<br /> <br /> I mean, the car can be the focal point of the story, the cause for the team to be united or a tool.<br /> - KITT is the sidekick in the show. It\u00b4s a true character in the show.<br /> - The MUTHER in Alien, is only an AI that control the ship and give the orders comming from Earth, filtering to garantee the crew is going to do as ordered. It is a plot device.<br /> - In Upload the car is controled by an AI and it end up killing the main character... not killing but almost... its even less than a plot device, it is a tool in the hands of the true villain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-31T19:06:07-07:00","id":1513494,"title":"","content":"KITT is a problem to model for several reasons.<br /> <br /> As a PC, KITT basically requires you to repeatedly split the party since cars sit in parking lots while people skulk around buildings, forests, etc. KITT also lacks hands or hand equivalents, which make many common tasks difficult to impossible.<br /> <br /> As a Follower, KITT's too powerful. KITT has Scale 4 ground speed on roads, Scale 3 or 4 armor, advanced and comprehensive sensors, the ability to neutralize nearby electronic devices, and a concealed arsenal of exotic weapons, among many other benefits. This is beyond the scope of normal Follower support.<br /> <br /> As equipment, KITT basically requires the Wondrous Item and/or Loaded Enhanced Edges since it has an absurd number of tags.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-01T11:44:01-07:00","id":1513555,"title":"","content":"Knight rider and related 80s schlock are great to think about for the Trinity Continuum. Back in the old Eon forums (I was dubbed Captether then), we used to knock around this sort of thing. One contributor married Battlestar Galactica and Knight Rider in that KITT and CARR were the result of reverse engineering CYLONs who had crashed on Earth. Of course, CARR remembered its origins and had summoned the CYLONS. <br /> <br /> Love it!<br /> <br /> On pondering how to handle KITT, the first thing that came to mind is the <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/368059/Trinity-Continuum-Pets\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Pets</a> supplement. It would take a bit of fiddling, but the robot pet rules might due for this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-02T15:52:26-07:00","id":1513719,"title":"","content":"That's actually a common fan-theory.<br /> <br /> Glen A. Larson created both Knight Rider (1982) and Battlestar Galactica (1978), and both shows use the back-and-forth sweeping LED light bar. BG used it for the cylons, and KR used it for KITT's front grill. So the theory goes that the advanced AI -- suspiciously advanced for 1982 -- was created by reverse-engineering cylon technology.<br /> <br /> Which is exactly the kind of fake cinematic universe that I love.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-02T16:21:45-07:00","id":1513723,"title":"","content":"It was new to me at the time. But I am a fan of such theories as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}